[00:25.35]Where have you been?
[00:25.35]你去了哪里？
[00:28.60]Been searching all along
[00:28.60]一直在探寻
[00:31.87]Came facing twilight on and on
[00:31.87]在这暮光中徘徊
[00:35.15]Without a clue
[00:35.15]未曾寻得一丝线索
[00:38.40]Without a sign
[00:38.40]未曾寻得半分踪迹
[00:41.64]Without grasping yet
[00:41.64]连真正该问的问题
[00:44.85]The real question to be asked
[00:44.85]都未曾知晓
[00:48.13]Where have I been?
[00:48.13]我去了哪里？
[00:51.50]I'm a shape shifter
[00:51.50]我一人千面
[00:54.78]At Poe's masquerade
[00:54.78]在这舞会上独舞
[00:57.80]Hiding both face and mind
[00:57.80]隐去了面容与心灵
[01:01.06]All free for you to draw
[01:01.06]真容任你想象
