[02:22.32]I'm a shape shifter
[02:22.32]我一人千面
[02:25.56]Chained down to my core
[02:25.56]却被我的真心拘束
[02:28.65]Please don't take off my mask
[02:28.65]请不要夺走我的面具
[02:31.92]My place to hide
[02:31.92]我的容身之所
[03:01.64]I can't tell you
[03:01.64]我也不能告诉你
[03:04.32]How to see me
[03:04.32]如何才能看到真正的我
[03:07.63]Nest a cage of bones
